                <button class="sub-tab" data-sub="step3">Step 3</button>
            </div>

            <div class="sub-tab-content active" id="step1">
                <div class="content-block">
                    <div>
                        <h3>Step 1</h3>
                        <p>
                            The student is tested and interviewed in various
                            skills including reasoning, language, and
                            interpersonal skills.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <img
                        src="https://ik.imagekit.io/brandswift/isoe/assets/images/facilities/admission-1.webp?updatedAt=1745912103337"
                        alt="Grade 1 admission"
                    />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="sub-tab-content" id="step2">
                <div class="content-block">
                    <div>
                        <h3>Step 2</h3>
                        <p>
                            Prospective students undergo an aptitude/entrance
                            test. Admission is based on the performance.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <img
                        src="https://ik.imagekit.io/brandswift/isoe/assets/images/facilities/admission-2.webp?updatedAt=1745912103538"
                        alt="Grade 1 admission"
                    />
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="sub-tab-content" id="step3">
                <div class="content-block">
                    <div>
                        <h3>Step 3</h3>
                        <p>
                            Final admission confirmation is done post interview
                            and performance review.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <img
                        src="https://ik.imagekit.io/brandswift/isoe/assets/images/academics/seniorkg.JPG?updatedAt=1745912240941"
