                        <li>Copy of Immunization card</li>
                        <li>Copy of Birth certificate</li>
                        <li>
                            Transfer Certificate from previous school (from
                            Grade 1 onwards)
                        </li>
                        <li>Previous academic records</li>
                        <li>
                            Three recent passport-size photographs of the child
                        </li>
                        <li>One photograph each of Parent/Guardian</li>
                        <li>
                            Aadhar Card copy of Student and Parents/Guardian
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <img
                    src="https://ik.imagekit.io/brandswift/isoe/assets/images/facilities/admission-procedure.webp?updatedAt=1745912104374"
